      "completion_summary": "Verified each integration against the code. STORAGE: `createStorage()` at apps/api/src/storage/objectStorage.ts:30-32 returns `new LocalStorage(env.STORAGE_LOCAL_DIR)` unconditionally — `STORAGE_DRIVER`, `S3_BUCKET`, `S3_REGION`, `S3_ACCESS_KEY_ID`, `S3_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY`, `S3_ENDPOINT` are parsed at apps/api/src/config/env.ts:15-21 and referenced NOWHERE else. Setting `STORAGE_DRIVER=s3` is a silent no-op. EMAIL: `deliverEmail` at apps/api/src/services/notificationService.ts:24-30 logs `email_console` or `email_smtp_not_fully_configured` and never sends; the `SMTP_*` vars (env.ts:26-31) are unreferenced. `requestPasswordReset` (apps/api/src/services/authService.ts:185-197) creates a `passwordReset` row and logs `password_reset_issued` but never calls `deliverEmail`, so no reset link ever reaches anyone. QUEUE: `REDIS_URL` (env.ts:14) is referenced nowhere in source; `ioredis` is in apps/api/package.json:32 but never imported; apps/api/src/worker.ts:8-16 is a plain `setInterval` calling `runSlaSweep()` every 60s. MAPS: `MAPTILER_KEY` and `COOKIE_DOMAIN` appear in .env.example:46,50 but are absent from envSchema entirely (env.ts:3-38); apps/web/src/components/LocationMap.tsx:41 hits OSM tiles directly. REAL: the geocoder at apps/api/src/geo/geocoder.ts:24-66 makes genuine fetches to nominatim.openstreetmap.org. AI: apps/api/src/ai/provider.ts:120-126 falls back to the keyword `MockProvider` (22-69) when no key is set; the real `OpenAiProvider` is 71-118. REPO: `git status` reports \"Not a git repository\" (ev-000000000302) — there is not a single commit. CI at .github/workflows/ci.yml:42-48 runs migrate/lint/typecheck/test/build but never sets `RUN_API_INTEGRATION=1`, so integration tests stay skipped there too.",
